  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Charles A. Volkel is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=Corkman%20Hotel">Carlton Inn</ref> at 160–162 Leicester Street in the directories in 1900 and 1905.</p>
      <p>He is on the 1905 electoral roll at 160 Leicester Street, a publican.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=Corkman%20Hotel">Carlton Inn</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
      <p><hi rend="italic">This entry is a machine-assisted first draft by Common Ground, written from the directory and electoral-roll records. Only records that are clearly the same person, at the hotel's address and in a hotel trade, are linked to it. Please correct or add to it.</hi></p>
    </body>
